  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Stone Walls And Steel Bars**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n- **Ashland Breakdown**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **That Train That Carried My Girl From Town / Black Mountain Rag**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Hearbeat Of America**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Been All Around This World**: back after 94 archived shows (413 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Gold Rush**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Cold Cold World [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-11-09.BillyStringsRochesterNY2022** (recommended): audience recording; 29 songs; 145 min [1]\n- **billystrings2022-11-09.oldham.akgCK63.flac24**: source not stated; 29 songs; 145 min [2]\n- **billystrings2022-11-09.akgCK63.oldham.flac16**: source not stated; 29 songs; 145 min [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-11-09.BillyStringsRochesterNY2022**: taped by JT/NY; transferred by JT/NY; source: Aud > Schoeps CCM41's > Zoom F6 @ 32/48 [1]. Also: Audience recording using Schoeps CCM41 microphones into a Zoom F6, captured at 32-bit/48kHz; Edited in Sound Forge Pro 16 and converted to FLAC with Traders Little Helper [1]\n- **billystrings2022-11-09.oldham.akgCK63.flac24**: taped by Duncan Oldham; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: AKG CK63's> Nbob Cables>Baby Nbox >Zoom F3 [2]. Also: Audience recording with AKG CK63 microphones through Nbob cables and Baby Nbox into a Zoom F3, at 32-bit float/48kHz; Sound Forge Pro 16 used for fades and 24-bit conversion; then CDWAV, Traders Little Helper FLAC, Foobar2000 tagging [2]\n- **billystrings2022-11-09.akgCK63.oldham.flac16**: taped by Duncan Oldham; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: AKG CK63's> Nbob Cables>Baby Nbox >Zoom F3 [3]. Also: Same AKG CK63/Zoom F3 source recorded at 32-bit float/48kHz, then downconverted to 16-bit, 44.1kHz in Sound Forge Pro 16; Processed via CDWAV, Traders Little Helper to FLAC, with Foobar2000 used for track tagging [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Simkl: [Billy Strings | 2022.11.09 — Blue Cross Arena - Rochester, NY (2022)](https://simkl.com/movies/2046113/billy-strings-|-20221109-—-blue-cross-arena---rochester-ny) [5]",
